  "description": "Source ruler A=0,B=2,C=5 contrasted with noncollinear triangle A-B-C. Preserve all 0..7 ticks and the original two-panel arrangement.",
  "source": {
    "image": {"path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/6-8g/figures/fig-11.png", "sha256": "18e0f9e3e97f01c3d467998356d475fffcc0d88eac1df34593e4862eae2d209a"},
    "authoritativeText": [
      {"lesson": "geo68-c1-s5", "text": "在一条直线上描出三点，你就会发现其中一点在另外两点之间．\n例如，点$B$在点$A$和$C$之间（图11，a）．\n在所选取的基本几何概念当中，没有“在……之间”这个概念．\n\n它可以利用“距离”和“点”的概念来定义．\n由图11，a可以看出，距离$|AC|$等于距离$|AB|$与$|BC|$的和．\n当点$B$在点$A$和$C$之间时，这句话总是对的．\n\n现在我们给出定义．"},
      {"lesson": "geo68-c1-s5", "text": "从图11．\na和b自然可以看出：\n1）如果三点属于一条直线（图11，a），那么其中的一点在另外两点之间；\n2）如果三点不属于一条直线（图11，b），那么任何一点都不在另外两点之间．"}
    ],
    "inventory": [
      {"id": "source-ruler", "description": "Left source panel: ruler top edge with eight equal unit ticks 0 through7, A at0, B at2, C at5; letters above and numbers below. Source ruler outer frame has a broken/wavy right end, regularized to plain frame with same eight ticks, not extended scale. No units or additional measurements. Original a tag modernized as (a).", "objects": ["r-a","r-b","r-c","r-frame","tick0","tick1","tick2","tick3","tick4","tick5","tick6","tick7","value0","value1","value2","value3","value4","value5","value6","value7","tag-a"], "assertions": ["r-collinear","r-ab","r-bc"], "requires": ["pointRelationships"]},
      {"id": "source-triangle", "description": "Right source panel: triangle with A lower-left, B upper and between A/C horizontally, C lower-right, all three side strokes and endpoint dots. No lengths or equal marks. Original b tag modernized as (b); unmeasured pose regularization only.", "objects": ["t-a","t-b","t-c","t-ab","t-bc","t-ca","tag-b"], "assertions": ["t-ab-position","t-bc-position","t-ab-connect","t-bc-connect","t-ca-connect"], "requires": ["pointRelationships"]}
    ]
